1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:04,647
Part 15 mein godown ka kaam: approved orders ki pick list,

2
00:00:04,647 --> 00:00:11,517
mobile phone par rack aur batch dekh kar picking, kam maal milne par short pick, packing,

3
00:00:11,517 --> 00:00:13,678
aur packed order ka invoice.

4
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:21,565
Owner ki screen par Pick and pack menu mein badge dikhta hai: kitni pick lists baaki hain.

5
00:00:21,565 --> 00:00:27,856
Yeh queue sabse purane order se shuru hoti hai, taaki koi order peeche na chhoote.

6
00:00:28,548 --> 00:00:33,035
Lekin picking godown ka staff apne phone par karta hai.

7
00:00:33,035 --> 00:00:38,990
Yeh hai Rahul, demo warehouse staff, jo employee ID aur PIN se login hai.

8
00:00:38,990 --> 00:00:44,456
Uske phone par sirf Pick and pack jaise godown ke kaam dikhte hain.

9
00:00:47,287 --> 00:00:51,538
Rahul Ramgarh Janta Medical ki pick list kholta hai.

10
00:00:51,538 --> 00:00:57,833
Har line par rack number, product, batch, expiry aur kitne packs uthane hain.

11
00:00:57,833 --> 00:01:05,355
Lines rack ke pick order mein lagi hain, taaki godown mein ek hi chakkar mein sab mil jaaye.

12
00:01:06,104 --> 00:01:07,853
Start picking dabaiye.

13
00:01:07,853 --> 00:01:15,484
Ab order ka status Picking ho gaya, aur office mein sabko dikhta hai ki maal uthaya ja raha hai.

14
00:01:16,174 --> 00:01:23,120
Pehli line: rack number dekha, batch match kiya, packs uthaye, aur Picked all dabaya.

15
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:30,474
Har line ke saath batch number milana zaroori hai, taaki galat batch chemist tak na jaaye.

16
00:01:31,167 --> 00:01:37,904
Agli line par shelf par maal kam nikla, toh Short dabaiye aur jitna mila utna likhiye.

17
00:01:37,904 --> 00:01:42,134
Short pick par invoice sirf uthaye hue maal ka banega,

18
00:01:42,134 --> 00:01:45,659
aur free goods bhi usi anupaat mein ghatenge.

19
00:01:46,399 --> 00:01:48,697
Baaki lines par Picked all.

20
00:01:48,697 --> 00:01:56,270
Saari lines pick hone ke baad, kitne boxes mein pack kiya, woh likhiye, aur Pack dabaiye.

21
00:01:56,270 --> 00:02:01,035
Order packed ho gaya aur ab invoice ke liye taiyaar hai.

22
00:02:01,711 --> 00:02:03,312
Wapas office mein.

23
00:02:03,312 --> 00:02:06,514
Order ab Packed to invoice mein hai.

24
00:02:06,514 --> 00:02:09,716
Order kholkar Raise invoice dabaiye.

25
00:02:09,716 --> 00:02:17,187
Invoice bilkul utne maal ka banta hai jitna pick hua, usi batch aur expiry ke saath.

26
00:02:17,902 --> 00:02:25,369
Picking ki galti distribution mein sabse mehngi galti hoti hai: galat product, galat batch,

27
00:02:25,369 --> 00:02:26,354
ya kam maal.

28
00:02:26,354 --> 00:02:34,067
Rack, batch aur quantity ki line-by-line confirmation se yeh galtiyan kaafi kam ho jaati hain.

29
00:02:34,067 --> 00:02:37,842
Barcode scan se picking abhi uplabdh nahi hai.
